d from that order.'=>'当购物车总金额符合条件时，该规则适用于整个订单。积分操作将影响该订单中获得的所有积分。','Applies when the customer\'s all-time points total matches the threshold. The points action affects all points earned from the matching way to earn (the whole order for order-based methods).'=>'当客户的历史累计积分达到阈值时生效。该积分操作将影响通过对应积分获取方式获得的所有积分（对于基于订单的积分获取方式，则指整笔订单）。','Applies when the customer\'s current available (spendable) points balance matches the threshold. The points action affects all points earned from the matching way to earn (the whole order for order-based methods).'=>'当客户的当前可用（可消费）积分余额达到阈值时生效。该积分操作将影响通过对应积分获取方式赚取的所有积分（对于基于订单的获取方式，则指整个订单）。','Applies when the points are earned by a customer with one of the selected user roles. The points action affects all points earned from the matching way to earn (the whole order for order-based methods).'=>'当客户以所选用户角色之一赚取积分时，此规则生效。该积分操作将影响通过对应积分获取方式赚取的所有积分（对于基于订单的获取方式，则指整个订单）。','Applies when the points are earned by one of the selected customers. The points action affects all points earned from the matching way to earn (the whole order for order-based methods).'=>'当积分由所选客户之一赚取时生效。该积分操作将影响通过对应积分获取方式赚取的所有积分（对于基于订单的获取方式，则指整个订单）。','Apply'=>'申请','Apply & Shop Now'=>'立即申请并选购','Apply Coupon'=>'使用优惠券','Apply dark mode to header box'=>'将深色模式应用于页眉框','Apply Filters'=>'应用筛选条件','Apply tax reduction to redeemed points'=>'对已兑换的积分适用减税政策','Apply To'=>'申请','Apply to Cart'=>'添加到购物车','Applying...'=>'正在申请中...','Approximate cash value of current points.'=>'当前积分的大致现金价值。','Are you sure you want to delete this guest record?'=>'您确定要删除此访客记录吗？','Are you sure you want to remove these points?'=>'您确定要删除这些积分吗？','Array of user roles allowed to earn it (empty = all roles).'=>'允许获得该奖励的用户角色数组（为空表示所有角色）。','As an admin you can view and manage guest customer points from the "Guest Points" admin page.'=>'作为管理员，您可以在“访客积分”管理页面中查看和管理访客积分。','Auto-apply coupon URL (claimed emails)'=>'自动应用优惠券网址（已领取的邮件）','Auto-apply coupon when referral link is visited'=>'当访问推荐链接时自动应用优惠券','Auto-delete Expired Items'=>'自动删除过期项目','Auto-delete Expired Rewards'=>'自动删除过期奖励','Auto-Delete Expired Vouchers'=>'自动删除过期凭证','Auto-delete Expired Vouchers'=>'自动删除过期优惠券','Auto-Delete Used Vouchers'=>'自动删除已使用的凭证','Auto-delete Used Vouchers'=>'自动删除已使用的凭证','Auto-generated Unique Coupons'=>'自动生成的唯一优惠券','Automatic Points Expiry'=>'积分自动过期','Automatic Points Tracking'=>'自动积分追踪','Automatic Release'=>'自动释放','Automatic Voucher Expiry'=>'凭证自动过期','Automatically add expiration to generated voucher coupons so old codes don\'t linger and confuse customers.'=>'在生成的优惠券中自动添加有效期，以免过期代码长期存在并造成顾客混淆。','Automatically apply an expiry date to reward vouchers when they are generated, keeping your coupon list tidy.'=>'在生成奖励券时自动为其设置有效期，让您的优惠券列表保持整洁有序。','Automatically clean up expired vouchers and expired reward coupons on a daily schedule so your coupon list stays organised.'=>'按照每日计划自动清理过期的优惠券和过期的奖励券，让您的优惠券列表始终井井有条。','Automatically delete expired rewards'=>'自动删除过期的奖励','Automatically expire points after a set period to encourage timely redemptions and repeat orders.'=>'在设定时间后自动使积分失效，以鼓励用户及时兑换积分并重复下单。','Automatically purge rewards that have passed their expiry date to keep lists accurate and up-to-date.'=>'自动清除已过期的奖励，以确保列表准确且最新。','Automatically remove voucher coupons from WooCommerce once they have been redeemed, preventing clutter.'=>'优惠券一经兑换，即自动从WooCommerce中移除，避免页面杂乱。','Automatically reset a customer\'s point balance to zero if they haven\'t earned any new points within a configurable window - e.g. 365 days.'=>'如果客户在可配置的时间段内（例如 365 天）未获得任何新积分，则自动将其积分余额重置为零。','Automatically send an email to guest customers reminding them to create an account and claim their points. Runs via WP-Cron.'=>'自动向访客客户发送电子邮件，提醒他们注册账户并兑换积分。通过 WP-Cron 运行。','Available'=>'有货','Available %s'=>'可用 %s','Available Balance'=>'可用余额','Available now - click to spin!'=>'现已上线——点击旋转！','Available options'=>'可用选项','Available Placeholders'=>'可用占位符','Available placeholders:'=>'可用的占位符：','Available placeholders: {user_name}, {user_email}, {level_name}, {previous_level_na