ral gift coupon cookies expire and how to display the countdown.'=>'配置推荐礼品券 Cookie 的过期时间以及倒计时的显示方式。','Congratulations! You have earned points.'=>'恭喜！您已获得积分。','Congratulations! You reached {level_name}'=>'恭喜！您已达到 {level_name} 级','Connect a standalone page that contains the rewards dashboard shortcode.'=>'连接一个包含奖励仪表盘短代码的独立页面。','Control how many times each referred customer can use their gift coupon. Each customer gets their own unique coupon code.'=>'控制每位被推荐客户可以使用礼品券的次数。每位客户都会获得一个唯一的优惠券代码。','Control how referral coupons are validated and tracked when used by customers.'=>'控制客户使用推荐优惠券时的验证和追踪方式。','Control how vouchers, rewards, and points expire or are cleaned up automatically.'=>'控制优惠券、奖励和积分的过期方式或自动清理方式。','Control the gift widget position, colour, and referral message.'=>'控制礼品小部件的位置、颜色和推荐信息。','Control the text and display elements shown when customers claim rewards.'=>'控制客户兑换奖励时显示的文本和显示元素。','Control when and how gift coupons can be used by referred customers.'=>'控制被推荐客户何时以及如何使用礼品券。','Control when the widget appears and which customer-facing controls it shows.'=>'控制小部件何时显示，以及显示哪些面向客户的控件。','Control where customers see earning messages on product and catalog pages.'=>'控制客户在产品和商品目录页面上看到积分提示的位置。','Controls the accent color used for points totals, buttons, and highlights in the checkout rewards box.'=>'控制结账奖励框中用于积分总数、按钮和突出显示部分的强调色。','Controls the background color of the points message on category/shop listings.'=>'控制分类/店铺列表中“积分”消息的背景颜色。','Controls the background color of the points message on product pages.'=>'控制产品页面上“积分”消息的背景颜色。','Controls the font color of descriptive text such as "You have X Reward Points" and limit notices inside the points discount tool.'=>'控制积分折扣工具中诸如“您拥有 X 积分”等说明性文字以及限时通知的字体颜色。','Controls the font color of the points message on category/shop listings.'=>'控制分类/店铺列表中“积分”消息的字体颜色。','Controls the font color of the points message on product pages.'=>'控制产品页面上“积分”消息的字体颜色。','Controls the success accents used for earning messages, reward values, and redeem butt