ket'=>'火箭','Rule label:'=>'规则标签：','Rule type:'=>'规则类型：','Rule:'=>'规则：','Rules'=>'规则','Rules can target any active earning method: order spend, signup bonus, daily login, birthday, reviews, referrals, social share, and more.'=>'规则可针对任何有效的赚取方式：订单消费、注册奖励、每日登录、生日、评论、推荐、社交分享等。','Run daily cleanups to remove expired voucher coupons and reduce database clutter automatically.'=>'每天运行清理任务，自动删除过期的优惠券，从而减少数据库中的冗余数据。','Run the inactivity expiry process immediately instead of waiting for the daily cron.'=>'立即运行休眠过期处理流程，而不是等待每日定时任务。','Save'=>'保存','Save All Settings'=>'保存所有设置','Saved for later'=>'已保存以备后用','Saved!'=>'已保存！','Saving...'=>'正在保存...','Schedule automated follow-up emails to remind guests of their waiting points balance and encourage them to create an account.'=>'安排自动发送跟进邮件，提醒客人其积分余额，并鼓励他们注册账户。','Seamless Points Transfer'=>'无缝积分转移','Search'=>'搜索','Search and select a WooCommerce product for the free product reward'=>'搜索并选择一款 WooCommerce 产品作为免费产品奖励','Search and select two or more products. All of them are added to the cart for free when the bundle is redeemed.'=>'搜索并选择两件或更多商品。兑换该套装时，所有商品都将免费加入购物车。','Search by Email'=>'按电子邮件搜索','Search by name or email'=>'按姓名或电子邮件地址搜索','Search customers'=>'搜索客户','Search for products…'=>'搜索产品……','Search Gift Coupons'=>'搜索礼品券','Search Voucher Coupons'=>'搜索优惠券','Secondary Accent Color'=>'辅助强调色','Secondary Theme Color'=>'次要主题颜色','Security check failed.'=>'安全检查失败。','Select'=>'选择','Select a plugin…'=>'选择一个插件……','Select All'=>'全选','Select an existing coupon to use as a template. All coupon settings (minimum spend, product restrictions, usage limits, etc) will be copied to the generated voucher. Discount type, amount, shipping, expiry, and customer email are always set by the reward.'=>'选择一个现有的优惠券作为模板。所有优惠券设置（最低消费金额、商品限制、使用次数限制等）都将复制到生成的优惠券中。折扣类型、折扣金额、运费、有效期和客户邮箱始终由奖励规则设定。','Select an existing coupon to use as a template. All settings except discount type, amount, usage limits, and expiry will be copied from this coupon.'=>'选择一个现有的优惠券作为模板。除折扣类型、折扣金额、使用限制和有效期外，所有设置都将从该优惠券中复制过来。','Select an icon'=>'选择一个图标','Select categories…'=>'选择类别……','Select coupon'=>'选择优惠券','Select Rewards Dashboard Page'=>'选择“奖励”仪表盘页面','Select Rewards Section'=>'选择“奖励”栏目','Selected plugin is not available for migration.'=>'所选插件无法进行迁移。','Send a reminder email a set number of days before inactivity expiry kicks in, giving customers a nudge to shop and save their balance.'=>'在账户闲置期到期前预设的天数内发送一封提醒邮件，提醒客户进行购物并保留账户余额。','Send a reminder this many days before the inactivity expiry. Set to 0 to skip reminders.'=>'在“闲置过期”前X天发送提醒。将该值设为0可跳过提醒。','Send email to customer on level up'=>'角色升级时向客户发送电子邮件','Send first reminder after (days):'=>'在（天）后发送第一条提醒：','Send Preview Email'=>'发送预览邮件','Send Reminder'=>'发送提醒','Send Reminder Email'=>'发送提醒邮件','Send reminders that encourage guest customers to create an account and claim their points.'=>'发送提醒，鼓励访客注册账户并兑换积分。','Sent before customer points expire due to inactivity. Configure timing in General Settings.'=>'在客户积分因长期未活跃而过期前发送。请在“常规设置”中配置发送时间。','Set a floor and/or ceiling on how many points a customer can earn in a single event, keeping rewards balanced.'=>'为客户在单次活动中可获得的积分设定下限和/或上限，以保持奖励的平衡。','Set a store-wide delay in hours or days so newly earned points only become available after your chosen review period.'=>'设置全店范围的延迟时间（以小时或天为单位），以便新赚取的积分在您选择的审核期结束后才能使用。','Set an expiry date to make this a limited-time reward with a countdown. Leave blank for no expiry.'=>'设置有效期，将此奖励设为带倒计时的限时奖励。如需无有效期，请留空。','Set Earning Methods'=>'设置赚取方式','Set expiry and cleanup rules for generated voucher coupons.'=>'为生成的优惠券设置有效期和清理规则。','Set expiry dates on rewards to create urgency and run limited-time promotions that drive timely redemptions.'=>'为奖励设置有效期，以营造紧迫感，并开展限时促销活动，从而推动用户及时兑换。','Set the main heading and supporting text shown at the top of the dashboard.'=>'设置仪表盘顶部显示的主标题和辅助文本。','Set the visual style and accent colours used by the checkout rewards box.'=>'设置结账奖励框所使用的视觉样式和强调色。','Set the widget position, size, colour, icon, and button text.'