t date:'=>'开始日期：','Start earning points to unlock levels!'=>'开始赚取积分，解锁关卡吧！','Start earning points to unlock your first level!'=>'开始积累积分，解锁你的第一个等级吧！','Start Free 7 Day Trial'=>'开始免费7天试用','Start Free Trial'=>'开始免费试用','Start migration'=>'开始迁移','Start Sync'=>'开始同步','Start time:'=>'开始时间：','Starter'=>'开胃菜','Status'=>'状态','Status updated.'=>'状态已更新。','Stop'=>'停止','Stop after the current batch finishes?'=>'当前批次完成后停止吗？','Strict Mode - Require Referral Link'=>'严格模式——要求提供推荐链接','Subject:'=>'主题：','Submit'=>'提交','Subtotal'=>'小计','Successful Referrals (Range)'=>'成功的推荐（范围）','Support'=>'支持','Sync Mode'=>'同步模式','Sync Points'=>'同步点','Tab Titles'=>'标签标题','Tabs left checked will appear for customers under the rewards dashboard. You can reorder them using the drag handles.'=>'保持勾选状态的标签页将显示在客户的“奖励”仪表盘下。您可以使用拖拽控点来调整它们的顺序。','Tabs left checked will appear for customers. The small text above each field shows the original tab name.'=>'保持勾选状态的选项卡将显示给客户。每个字段上方的微小文字显示的是原始选项卡名称。','Target'=>'目标','Target Any Earning Method'=>'针对任何赚钱方式','Target role:'=>'目标职位：','Target: %s'=>'目标：%s','tax'=>'税','Telegram'=>'Telegram','Template Coupon'=>'优惠券模板','Template Coupon (optional):'=>'优惠券模板（可选）：','Terms'=>'术语','Terms and Conditions'=>'条款与条件','Terms Content'=>'术语内容','Terms Display Settings'=>'术语显示设置','Text Color:'=>'文字颜色：','Text or HTML to wrap the output.'=>'用于包裹输出的文本或HTML。','Thank-you Page Prompt'=>'感谢页提示','Thanks for the review! {points} {points_label} earned'=>'感谢您的评论！获得了 {points} {points_label}','The "redeem rewards" will be hidden on the rewards dashboard, checkout box, and floating widget.'=>'“兑换奖励”功能将在奖励仪表盘、结账框和悬浮小工具中被隐藏。','The checkout rewards box allows customers to view the points they will earn on their order, claim rewards, and redeem vouchers.'=>'“结账奖励”框可让顾客查看该笔订单将获得的积分、领取奖励以及兑换优惠券。','The main heading on the rewards dashboard. Use {points_label} to insert the points name.'=>'奖励仪表板上的主标题。使用 {points_label} 插入积分名称。','The minimum quantity must be met within a single order.'=>'单笔订单必须达到最低订购量。','The points could not be added because the user is banned.'=>'由于该用户已被封禁，因此无法添加积分。','The products this rule applies to. For a bundle, all listed products must be purchased. For a single rule, buying any one of the listed products qualifies.'=>'本规则适用的商品。如果是套装，必须购买所列的所有商品；如果是单条规则，购买所列商品中的任意一件即可满足条件。','The referral gift widget appears for customers when they click on a referral link, allowing them to easily claim their gift coupon.'=>'当客户点击推荐链接时，推荐礼品小工具就会显示出来，让他们可以轻松领取礼品券。','The rewards program is available to registered customers only. Participation is free and open to all registered account holders.'=>'该奖励计划仅面向已注册的客户。参与完全免费，所有已注册账户持有人均可参加。','The spin wheel is not currently available.'=>'转盘目前无法使用。','The start date must be before the end date.'=>'开始日期必须早于结束日期。','The sub-heading text below the main dashboard title.'=>'位于主仪表盘标题下方的副标题文本。','The voucher "%s" has been deleted because it expired.'=>'优惠券“%s”因已过期而被删除。','The widget floats over any page automatically when a referral link is clicked - no shortcodes or page edits required.'=>'点击推荐链接后，该小工具会自动悬浮在任何页面上——无需使用短代码或编辑页面。','The WordPress options table cannot store 4-byte Unicode characters, so emoji icons or emoji-only custom text in these settings will be converted to plain text when saved. To preserve emojis, ask your host to convert the options table option_value column to utf8mb4.'=>'WordPress 的选项表无法存储 4 字节的 Unicode 字符，因此这些设置中的表情符号或仅由表情符号组成的自定义文本在保存时会被转换为纯文本。若要保留表情符号，请联系您的主机服务商，将选项表中的 option_value 列转换为 utf8mb4 编码。','Theme Colors'=>'主题颜色','Theme Settings'=>'主题设置','Theme Style:'=>'主题样式：','There are no processed updates to undo.'=>'没有已处理的更新可供撤销。','There are still pending points in the queue. They will continue to be awarded on their scheduled date even while this setting is disabled.'=>'队列中仍有待处理的项目。即使禁用了此设置，这些项目仍将在预定日期继续发放积分。','These control the gradient colors on the Rewards dashboard such as the header, icons, borders, and buttons.'=>'这些选项用于控制“奖励”仪表板上的渐变颜色，例如页眉、图标、边框和按钮。','These terms are governed by applicable local laws. By participating in the program, you agree to these terms and any future amendments.'=>'本条款受当地适用法律的约束。参与本计划即表示您同意本条款及未来可能作出的任何修订。','They get access to your gift discount'=>'他们可以享受您的礼品折扣','They then get a gift coupon to use'=>'随后，他们将获得一张礼品券，可以用来','This bulk points job could not be found or has expired.'=>'无法找到此批量积分任务，或者该任务已过期。简体中文（大陆）','This bulk points job has already been undone.'=>'这项批量加点操作已经撤销。','This bundle has no products configured.'=>'此套装中未配置任何产品。','This coupon can only be used through a referral link.'=>'此优惠券仅可通过推荐链接使用。','This coupon is connected to the user\'s referral link (e.g., https://example.com/?ref=ABC123)'=>'该优惠券与用户的推荐链接相关联（例如：https://example.com/?ref=ABC123）','This coupon is not valid for your current session.'=>'此优惠券不适用于您当前的会话。','This email belongs to a registered customer. Adjust their points from the Customer Points page.'=>'该邮箱属于一位已注册的客户。请在“客户积分”页面调整其积分。','This generates a basic template based on your current plugin settings. Please review and adapt the content to suit your specific business requirements before publishing, and seek legal advice if required.'=>'这将根据您当前的插件设置生成一个基本模板。发布前，请仔细检查并根据您的具体业务需求调整内容，如有必要，请寻求法律建议。','This is a more simple, traditional points redemption method that does not require setting up individual rewards.'=>'这是一种更简单、更传统的积分兑换方式，无需设置单独的奖励。','This is the exact list customers see. Add to it using the Custom Benefits field above.'=>'这就是客户看到的完整列表。您可以通过上方的“自定义福利”字段向其中添加内容。','This message appears above the discount amount in the floating gift widget.'=>'该消息显示在浮动礼品小部件中的折扣金额上方。','This offer is no longer available.'=>'此优惠已过期。','This Order:'=>'本命令：','This page shows the history of points earned and redeemed by users.'=>'本页面显示了用户积分的赚取和兑换记录。','This page tracks every prize wheel spin and every time a customer earns bonus spins.'=>'本页面会记录每次奖品转盘的旋转以及客户每次获得奖励旋转的情况。','This process runs on a daily cron schedule. Ensure WP-Cron is working on your site.'=>'该流程按每日 cron 计划运行。请确保您的网站上 WP-Cron 正在正常运行。','This reward has expired and is no longer available.'=>'该奖励已过期，不再提供。','This voucher could not be applied. It is not valid for your current cart.'=>'无法使用此优惠券。该优惠券不适用于您当前的购物车。','This voucher could not be applied. It may have usage restrictions or have already been used.'=>'无法使用此优惠券。该优惠券可能存在使用限制，或者已被使用过。','This way to earn is registered from your code and is read-only here. To change its options, edit where you called spar_register_custom_earn_way(). Drag it to change its display order.'=>'此收益方式已通过您的代码进行注册，在此处仅为只读状态。若要更改其选项，请编辑调用 spar_register_custom_earn_way() 的代码。拖动该项可更改其显示顺序。','This will update the selected data for all customers within the Simple Points and Rewards plugin. A backup is recommended before proceeding.'=>'这将更新“Simple Points and Rewards”插件中所有客户已选中的数据。建议在继续操作前进行备份。','thousands short format%sk'=>'%sk','Ticket (Voucher)'=>'票券（凭证）','TikTok'=>'TikTok','Title'=>'标题','Title shown to customers and in this list.'=>'向客户显示的标题以及在此列表中显示的标题。','To'=>'致','To date'=>'截至目前','Today'=>'今天','Toggle dark mode'=>'切换深色模式','Top Earners'=>'收入最高者','Top Left'=>'左上角','Top Redeemers'=>'兑换次数最多的用户','Top Referrers (by points in range)'=>'推荐来源排名前列（按积分范围排序）','Top Right'=>'右上角','Total'=>'总计','Total Earned'=>'应得总额','Total earned is %s.'=>'总收入为 %s。','Total Guests'=>'宾客总数','Total lifetime cap per user (0 = unlimited).'=>'每位用户的总使用上限（0 表示无限制）。','Total Pending:'=>'待处理总数：','Total Points'=>'总分','Total Points Earned'=>'累计得分','Total Points Earned (Lifetime)'=>'累计积分（总计）','Total points earned (lifetime)'=>'累计积分（总计）','Total points earned from referrals.'=>'通过推荐获得的总积分。','Total Points Earned: Levels are based on the total points a customer has earned over time. Points spent on rewards do not affect their level.'=>'累计积分：等级基于客户随时间累积的总积分确定。用于兑换奖励的积分不影响其等级。','Total points is above'=>'总分如上','Total points is below'=>'总分如下','Total Redeemed'=>'已兑换总数','Total Redeemed Points (All-time)'=>'累计兑换积分（历史总计）','Total referral clicks.'=>'推荐点击总数。','Total Referrals'=>'推荐总数','Total Spend'=>'总支出','Total Spins'=>'总旋转次数','Total spins: %d'=>'总旋转次数：%d','Total successful referrals.'=>'成功推荐的总数。','Total Users'=>'用户总数','Total Value'=>'总价值','Total:'=>'合计：','Total: %1$d %2$s'=>'总计：%1$d %2$s','Track customer points performance, activity logs, and referral metrics.'=>'跟踪客户积分表现、活动日志和推荐指标。','Track points earned by guest (non-registered) customers when they place orders.'=>'跟踪访客（未注册）客户下单时获得的积分。','Track points for guest checkout orders and automatically migrate them when the customer registers or logs in.'=>'为访客结账订单记录积分，并在客户注册或登录时自动迁移这些积分。','Track points for guest checkout orders and migrate them when customers create an account.'=>'跟踪访客结账订单的积分，并在客户创建账户时将其迁移。','Track your rewards, level up, and claim exciting benefits!'=>'追踪您的奖励，提升等级，并领取丰厚福利！','Tracked over time (accumulates across orders)'=>'随时间推移进行追踪（跨订单累计）','Tracking:'=>'追踪：','Trash'=>'垃圾','Trophy'=>'奖杯','Try PRO for free!'=>'免费试用 PRO 版！','Turn every customer into a brand ambassador. When someone shares their referral link, their referred visitors are automatically offered a personalised discount coupon - creating a compelling reason to make that first purchase.'=>'让每位客户都成为品牌推广大使。当有人分享其推荐链接时，被推荐的访客会自动获得一张个性化折扣券——这为他们首次购买提供了极具吸引力的理由。','Type'=>'类型','Type:'=>'类型：','Unable to access cart. Please refresh and try again.'=>'无法访问购物车。请刷新页面后重试。','Unchanged'=>'未更改','Undo'=>'撤销','Undo + Delete'=>'撤销 + 删除','Undo + Update Log'=>'撤销 + 更新日志','Undo all processed updates for this batch?'=>'是否要撤销该批次的所有已处理更新？','Undo failed: %s'=>'撤销失败：%s','Undo Processed Updates'=>'撤销已处理的更新','Undo: %s'=>'撤销：%s','Undo: Admin points adjustment'=>'撤销：管理员积分调整','Undoing processed updates...'=>'正在撤销已处理的更新……','Undone'=>'未完成','Unknown'=>'未知','Unknown prize type.'=>'奖项类型未知。','Unknown reward type.'=>'未知奖励类型。','Unknown user'=>'未知用户','Unlimited'=>'无限','Unlimited Levels & Badges'=>'无限关卡与徽章','Unlimited Rewards'=>'无限奖励','Unlimited uses'=>'无限次使用','Unlock More Features with PRO'=>'升级至 PRO 版，解锁更多功能','Unlock powerful premium features to take your rewards program to the next level!'=>'解锁强大的高级功能，让您的奖励计划更上一层楼！','Until %s'=>'直到 %s','Untitled Level'=>'无标题关卡'