iscount fee so Avalara can reduce the taxable order amount.'=>'启用此功能后，积分兑换将作为应税折扣费计入，以便Avalara相应减少应税订单金额。','When enabled, reward coupons that have passed their expiry date will be removed automatically.'=>'启用此功能后，已过期的奖励优惠券将被自动删除。','When enabled, the Discount Value preview follows WooCommerce cart and checkout tax display: tax-inclusive stores show the combined value, while tax-exclusive stores show the base value with the tax amount beside it.'=>'启用后，“折扣金额”预览将遵循 WooCommerce 购物车和结账页面的税费显示规则：含税商店显示含税总金额，而不含税商店则显示基础金额，并在其旁边显示税额。','When enabled, the generated coupon will grant free shipping on the order (requires a Free Shipping method that accepts coupons).'=>'启用此功能后，生成的优惠券将为该订单提供免运费服务（需使用支持优惠券的免运费配送方式）。','When enabled, use the {sender} placeholder in your message to insert the referrer\'s first name (e.g., "{sender} has sent you a gift!"). If no {sender} placeholder is found, "A customer" will be replaced instead.'=>'启用此功能后，可在消息中使用 {sender} 占位符插入推荐人的名字（例如：“{sender} 给您送了一份礼物！”）。如果未找到 {sender} 占位符，则会用“一位客户”代替。','When they create an account, their points and activity log are automatically transferred.'=>'当他们创建账户时，其积分和活动记录会自动转移过来。','When they make a purchase, you earn points!'=>'当他们下单时，您就能获得积分！','Whenenever a customer visits your site through the users referral link, they will see the "gift offer" to apply that discount code to their cart'=>'每当有客户通过用户的推荐链接访问您的网站时，他们都会看到“礼品优惠”提示，可将该折扣码应用到购物车中。','Whether the way is active (default true).'=>'该路径是否为活动状态（默认值为 true）。','Widget Appearance'=>'小工具外观','Widget Color:'=>'小部件颜色：','Widget Icon:'=>'小部件图标：','Widget Position:'=>'小部件位置：','Widget Settings'=>'小工具设置','Widget Size:'=>'小部件尺寸：','Widget Text:'=>'小部件文本：','With this option enabled, customers can easily redeem their points for a discount on the cart or checkout page.'=>'启用此选项后，客户可以在购物车或结算页面轻松使用积分兑换折扣。','WooCommerce is required for vouchers.'=>'使用优惠券必须安装 WooCommerce。','WooCommerce orders are unavailable.'=>'WooCommerce 订单不可用。','WooCommerce Points and Rewards'=>'WooCommerce 积分与奖励','Works with Referral Coupons'=>'支持推荐优惠券','WPLoyalty'=>'WPLoyalty','Write a Review'=>'撰写评论','Write a review'=>'撰写评论','Write a Review (PRO)'=>'撰写评论（PRO）','Write your own message that appears above the discount amount - tailored to your brand voice.'=>'请撰写一段将显示在折扣金额上方的自定义信息——内容应符合您的品牌调性。','X'=>'X','Yes'=>'是','Yesterday'=>'昨天','YITH WooCommerce Points and Rewards'=>'YITH WooCommerce 积分与奖励','You can also award via the action hook %s.'=>'您还可以通过操作钩子 %s 进行奖励。','You can earn points by completing the following actions.'=>'您可以通过完成以下操作来赚取积分。','You can restrict access to specific products and pages by level'=>'您可以根据权限级别限制对特定产品和页面的访问权限','You can use these placeholders in your email subject and body:'=>'您可以在电子邮件的主题和正文中使用以下占位符：','You can use these shortcodes to display points and rewards data anywhere.'=>'您可以使用这些短代码在任何位置显示积分和奖励数据。','You can use these vouchers at checkout. If a voucher is marked as "Used", it has already been applied to an order.'=>'您可以在结账时使用这些优惠券。如果优惠券显示为“已使用”，则表示该优惠券已应用于某笔订单。','You cannot redeem this reward at this time.'=>'您目前无法兑换此奖励。','You do not have enough points.'=>'您的积分不足。','You do not have permission to access this page.'=>'您无权访问此页面。','You do not have permission to run this action.'=>'您无权执行此操作。','You do not have permission to view this page.'=>'您无权查看此页面。','You do not have sufficient permissions to access this page.'=>'您没有足够的权限访问此页面。','You earned points!'=>'你获得了积分！','You earned {points} {points_label} for a referral'=>'您因推荐他人获得了 {points} {points_label}','You earned {points} {points_label} for your order'=>'您因本次订单获得了 {points} {points_label}','You have %1$d %2$s. You can redeem this reward now.'=>'您有 %1$d 个 %2$s。您可以立即兑换此奖励。','You have %s day left before your points balance resets.'=>'距离您的积分余额重置还有 %s 天。' . "\0" . '','You have %s waiting for you!'=>'有 %s 在等着你！','You have +%s pending and available soon.'=>'您有 +%s 项待处理，即将可用。','You have already earned points for sharing.'=>'您因分享已获得积分。','You have already earned points for this network.'=>'您已经为该网络赚取了积分。','You have already used your spin.'=>'你已经用过一次旋转机会了。','You have {points_label} waiting for you!'=>'您有 {points_label} 正在等着您！','You haven\'t claimed any vouchers yet. Start earning points and redeem them for rewards!'=>'您尚未领取任何优惠券。快来赚取积分，并兑换奖励吧！','You must be logged in to earn points.'=>'您必须登录才能赚取积分。','You must be logged in to spin the wheel.'=>'您必须登录后才能转动转盘。','You must be logged in.'=>'您必须先登录。','You need %1$d more %2$s to buy a spin.'=>'您还需要 %1$d 个 %2$s 才能购买一次旋转。','You need %1$d more %2$s to redeem this reward.'=>'您还需要 %1$d 个 %2$s 才能兑换此奖励。','You need at least %d points to redeem.'=>'您需要至少 %d 积分才能兑换。','You purchased %d spin!'=>'您已购买 %d 次旋转！' . "\0" . '','You will earn %1$d %2$s from this order'=>'您将从这笔订单中获得 %1$d %2$s','You won %1$d %2$s!'=>'你赢得了 %1$d 个 %2$s！','You won a %1$s%2$s voucher! Code: %3$s'=>'您赢取了一张 %1$s%2$s 优惠券！代码：%3$s','You won a free %1$s! Code: %2$s'=>'您赢取了一份免费的 %1$s！兑换码：%2$s','You\'ve spent'=>'你已经花了','Your %1$s points are worth approximately %2$s%3$s.'=>'您的 %1$s 积分价值约为 %2$s%3$s。','Your account is banned from the rewards program.'=>'您的账户已被禁止参与奖励计划。','Your Claimed Vouchers'=>'您已领取的优惠券','Your Gift Coupon:'=>'您的礼品券：','Your Level & Progress'=>'您的等级与进度','Your points are due to expire today unless you earn new points.'=>'除非您赚取新积分，否则您的积分将于今天过期。','Your Referral Coupon Code'=>'您的推荐优惠码','Your Referral Coupon:'=>'您的推荐优惠券：','Your Referral Link:'=>'您的推荐链接：','Your reviews:'=>'您的评论：','Your reward is ready! Voucher code: {voucher_code}'=>'您的奖励已准备就绪！优惠码：{voucher_code}','Your voucher code is ready to use:'=>'您的优惠码已准备就绪，可以使用了：','Your voucher has been claimed!'=>'您的优惠券已兑换！','Your voucher has been successfully claimed.'=>'您的优惠券已成功兑换。','Your voucher was applied automatically.'=>'您的优惠券已自动抵扣。','Your voucher will be applied as soon as you add products to your cart.'=>'将商品加入购物车后，您的优惠券将立即生效。','Your Vouchers'=>'您的优惠券','{points_label} Dashboard'=>'{points_label} 仪表盘','—'=>'—','— Select a page —'=>'— 选择页面 —','← Previous'=>'← 上一页']];
